{
  "entity": "f_three_days_of_the_condor",
  "source": "data-seed/scripts/f_three_days_of_the_condor.txt",
  "scope": "the whole script, machine-extracted (24 windows)",
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JANICE",
      "quote": "It's busted. Heidegger was copying\n          something. You know him with machines.",
      "block": 1
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE'S VOICE",
      "quote": "This was in the pouch from New York\n          Center.",
      "block": 2
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "HQ at Langley says there's nothing from\n          any other intelligence source to support\n          your theory.",
      "block": 3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "Is this your idea of working on that\n          book?",
      "block": 4
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Oh, I'll have it on the computer by four.",
      "block": 5
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "We have people to service these machines.",
      "block": 6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "These things are fairly simple ... they\n          just look complicated.",
      "block": 7
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "Mr. Turner ... I wonder if you're\n          entirely happy here.",
      "block": 8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Within obvious limits, yes sir.",
      "block": 9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "Obvious limits?",
      "block": 10
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "I'd rather write... and... well it\n          bothers me that I can't tell people what\n          I do.",
      "block": 11
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "Why is it taking you so long to accept\n          that??",
      "block": 12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "I actually trust a few people.     It's a\n          problem.",
      "block": 13
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "(shaking his head)\n          I believe it's your turn to bring in\n          lunch.",
      "block": 14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "What time is it?",
      "block": 15
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "11:22.",
      "block": 16
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p3",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Rain should end by 11:30.",
      "block": 17
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "DR. LAPPE",
      "quote": "You can wait 8 minutes.",
      "block": 18
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JENNINGS",
      "quote": "Mr. Turner!",
      "block": 19
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JENNINGS",
      "quote": "Goddamnit!     That is not a proper exit!",
      "block": 20
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MRS. RUSSELL",
      "quote": "He always goes out that way when it rains\n          ... it saves him a block.",
      "block": 21
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JENNINGS",
      "quote": "Personnel should enter and exit premises\n          by authorized means only.",
      "block": 22
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MRS. RUSSELL",
      "quote": "(reaching for another\n               cigarette)\n          Gimme a light, will ya?",
      "block": 23
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JIMMY",
      "quote": "How's it going, Shakespeare?",
      "block": 24
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Great. I'm building one of the finest\n          collections of rejection slips in the\n          world.",
      "block": 25
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JIMMY",
      "quote": "I know the feeling: I always wanted to be\n          Escoffier.",
      "block": 26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "It's not too late.\n              (points)\n          No mayo on Dr. Lappe's.",
      "block": 27
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Van Gogh didn't begin painting until he\n          was almost 30...",
      "block": 28
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JIMMY",
      "quote": "Yeah?",
      "block": 29
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "On the other hand, Mozart was playing\n          piano at 3 and composing at 6.",
      "block": 30
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "JIMMY",
      "quote": "Fast-starter ... That's probably better.",
      "block": 31
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "Mark Ray's no batter.",
      "block": 32
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TURNER",
      "quote": "I don't know: Van Gogh never sold a",
      "block": 33
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Yes.",
      "block": 34
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Hey, you're early!",
      "block": 35
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Janice working late...?",
      "block": 36
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "So is Sam.",
      "block": 37
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Pour one for me,too, will you, Joe?   It's\n           their own fault if we're zonked --",
      "block": 38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "How do you know ... Sam is working late?",
      "block": 39
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Think he's up to something else?   Tom\n          catting around?",
      "block": 40
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "When did he call?",
      "block": 41
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "2, 2:30. Maybe. Hey! Let's give them\n          an hour? If they don't show ... it's you\n          and me babe.\n              (sings)\n          \"Just like old times, da-da-da-da-dah...\"",
      "block": 42
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What'd he tell you?   Exactly.",
      "block": 43
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "He didn't exactly.    Had the Center call.",
      "block": 44
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Who, at the Center?",
      "block": 45
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Not Miss Randolph. She's the one I\n          usually get, with the Baltimore accent:\n          'He's oot!'... No, this was a man.",
      "block": 46
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Did you recognize his voice?",
      "block": 47
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "No.",
      "block": 48
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "...Hey?   Where's our drinks?",
      "block": 49
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Hello?",
      "block": 50
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "That's the third damn time tonight!",
      "block": 51
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Third time...?",
      "block": 52
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I have to go.",
      "block": 53
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What? What'd I say??",
      "block": 54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I'm sorry!",
      "block": 55
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What's the matter?",
      "block": 56
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I'm so sorry, Mae!",
      "block": 57
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What about dinner?       What happened?",
      "block": 58
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I'll try to call ... but...",
      "block": 59
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What?    What is it??",
      "block": 60
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I can't! I'm sorry! Goodnight, Mae, I\n             don't know ... when...\n                 (stops; quickly)\n             Good-night!",
      "block": 61
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p10",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Your keys.",
      "block": 62
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Oh yes! ... Thanks.",
      "block": 63
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Don't mention it.",
      "block": 64
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "4th floor: Ladies' Underwear!",
      "block": 65
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p13",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Bet we've to wait an hour!",
      "block": 66
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Nah!      She'll be ready.",
      "block": 67
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p14",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Her name is Freddy, she must be ready!",
      "block": 68
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Kids...!",
      "block": 69
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": "p11",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "They different? Where you're from?\n          France?",
      "block": 70
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": "p4",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Corsica.",
      "block": 71
    }
  ],
